        <mxCell id="4" value="React + TypeScript Front-end (Vite)
• Render UI pages &amp;amp; role-based dashboards
• Forms, filters, and client-side validation
• Send API requests / receive JSON responses" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="60" width="600" height="100" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" value="ASP.NET Core Back-end / Web API
• RESTful controllers &amp;amp; server-side workflow logic
• Auth &amp;amp; RBAC middleware (Member / Creator / Trainer / Admin)
• Domain services: Users · Courses · Credits · Materials
  Enrolments · Certificates · Content Attribution · Records" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0EBFF;strokeColor=#7241FF;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=10;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
